OL,3,GNEWSAStudent strikes gold at
OL,4,ACommonwealth karate event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has brought home two gold
OL,7,Fmedals from the Commonwealth Karate
OL,8,FChampionships.
OL,10,FWilliam Jervis, from Grimsby,
OL,11,Frepresented England at the event in
OL,12,FGlasgow.
OL,14,FThe 18-year-old won gold in the men's
OL,15,FPara K22 category before claiming a
OL,16,Fsecond in the club section of the
OL,17,Fchampionships.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
