OL,3,GNEWSAStudent strikes gold at
OL,4,ACommonwealth karate event
OL,5,
OL,6,FJervis, a sports student at Grimsby
OL,7,FInstitute, said he was proud of the
OL,8,Fachievement, adding: "I have been doing
OL,9,Fkarate for nine years and I train for
OL,10,Fsix hours a week and do lots."
